        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Products: Red, Speak Now, I Knew You Were Trouble\n- Organizations: Big Machine Records\n- Events: The Red Tour\n- Places: Omaha, Nebraska, Singapore\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift released her fourth studio album, Red, on October 22, 2012, through Big Machine Records.\n- Red was released as the follow-up to Taylor Swift's third studio album, Speak Now.\n- Taylor Swift recorded the song \"I Knew You Were Trouble\" for her fourth studio album, Red, released in 2012.\n- The Red Tour was launched in support of Taylor Swift's fourth studio album, Red.\n- The Red Tour began on March 13, 2013, in Omaha, Nebraska.\n- The Red Tour concluded on June 12, 2014, in Singapore.",
